      <div class="feature"><img src="https://fast-chiptuningfiles.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/6W.png" alt="" onerror="this.src='https://cdn-icons-png.flaticon.com/512/3774/3774083.png'"><h4>Pop & Bang</h4><p>Louder exhaust pops sporty sound</p></div>
      <div class="feature"><img src="https://fast-chiptuningfiles.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/4-1-W.png" alt="" onerror="this.src='https://cdn-icons-png.flaticon.com/512/3774/3774083.png'"><h4>DPF off</h4><p>Remove DPF limits improve efficiency</p></div>
